{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_01",
      "hash": "0754a41f7a189db8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我在這裡\\n照顧那些受傷的寶可夢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_02",
      "hash": "0754a71f7a18a2d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "妙蛙種子已經\\n完全恢復活力了。\\c\\n我打算把這孩子交給一個\\n捉到過很多寶可夢的\\r\\n可靠訓練家……"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_08",
      "hash": "07549d1f7a1891d3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳至今為止\\n捉到的寶可夢有……\\r\\n[VAR NUM9(0000,0000)]隻！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_03",
      "hash": "0754a61f7a18a11e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "太厲害了！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以替我照顧妙蛙種子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_04",
      "hash": "0754a91f7a18a637",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_09",
      "hash": "07549c1f7a189020",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯……可以請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n在捉到[VAR NUM2(0000)]隻寶可夢之後再來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_05",
      "hash": "0754a81f7a18a484",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "妙蛙種子\\n有好好努力嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub037_adultf_06",
      "hash": "0754ab1f7a18a99d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這樣啊……\\n真遺憾……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub037_poke_01",
      "hash": "96bdf2947fd99335",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "妙蛙種子「種子～"
    }
  ],
